<lb_n lb_n="8">
<verse_n verse_n="8">
<translation translation="And it came to pass at the rising of the sun, that God commanded a burning east wind; and the sun smote on the head of Jonas, and he fainted, and despaired of his life, and said, It is better for me to die than to live.">
